<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Japan gives Togo $3.6 million for agriculture, debt.</title>
<headline>Japan gives Togo $3.6 million for agriculture, debt.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan has given Togo grants worth about 2.18 billion CFA francs ($3.6 million), the Japanese embassy in Abidjan said.</p>
<p>It is giving about 1.5 billion CFA francs for the purchase of agricultural products and equipment, and another 686 million that Togo will use to reduce debt arrears.</p>
</text>
